      "message": "ACK. This matches BlameServlet in Gitiles for now (and IgnoreRevFileReader bounds the file at 1 MiB / 20k revs, plus immutable patchset blame responses are HTTP-cached via CacheControl). Agreed that if we see overhead on large repos down the road, caching the parsed IgnoreRevsFile keyed by the .git-blame-ignore-revs blob ObjectId in BlameCache/IgnoreRevFileReader would be a nice follow-up so commits sharing the same blob don\u0027t re-parse it.",
